{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Man Who Walked</strong> is a puzzle game that combines two perspectives \u20142D and 3D\u2014 to create a challenging and original experience. The goal is simple: guide the character to the exit door in each level. But don\u2019t be fooled\u2014what seems straightforward soon reveals mechanics that will test your logic, creativity, and ability to experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/b54f02f7481b9b6558672e649fd7c185.poster.avif?t=1760682284\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/b54f02f7481b9b6558672e649fd7c185.webm?t=1760682284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/b54f02f7481b9b6558672e649fd7c185.mp4?t=1760682284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2D, you can rearrange pieces of the environment like sliding puzzles, unlocking paths and preparing the stage. In 3D, you take direct control of the protagonist: walking, pressing buttons, using elevators, and connecting circuits to open new routes. The key is learning to combine both perspectives to overcome every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/8a4fe933073cf6f1a9996f4015ee4b92.poster.avif?t=1760682284\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/8a4fe933073cf6f1a9996f4015ee4b92.webm?t=1760682284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/8a4fe933073cf6f1a9996f4015ee4b92.mp4?t=1760682284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 50 carefully designed levels, you\u2019ll discover a progression that starts accessible and grows increasingly challenging\u2014while always delivering the satisfaction of solving what once seemed impossible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay built around switching between 2D and 3D perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels with evolving and interconnected mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of puzzles, from moving blocks to activating circuits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist and atmospheric aesthetic, designed for a clear and relaxing experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080740?t=1760682284","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4080740?t=1760682284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/78d343d145645018b9c2fb471176e9f6291b2ae2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760682284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/78d343d145645018b9c2fb471176e9f6291b2ae2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760682284","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Man Who Walked</strong> is a puzzle game that combines two perspectives \u20142D and 3D\u2014 to create a challenging and original experience. The goal is simple: guide the character to the exit door in each level. But don\u2019t be fooled\u2014what seems straightforward soon reveals mechanics that will test your logic, creativity, and ability to experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/b54f02f7481b9b6558672e649fd7c185.poster.avif?t=1760682284\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/b54f02f7481b9b6558672e649fd7c185.webm?t=1760682284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/b54f02f7481b9b6558672e649fd7c185.mp4?t=1760682284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2D, you can rearrange pieces of the environment like sliding puzzles, unlocking paths and preparing the stage. In 3D, you take direct control of the protagonist: walking, pressing buttons, using elevators, and connecting circuits to open new routes. The key is learning to combine both perspectives to overcome every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/8a4fe933073cf6f1a9996f4015ee4b92.poster.avif?t=1760682284\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/8a4fe933073cf6f1a9996f4015ee4b92.webm?t=1760682284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/extras/8a4fe933073cf6f1a9996f4015ee4b92.mp4?t=1760682284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across 50 carefully designed levels, you\u2019ll discover a progression that starts accessible and grows increasingly challenging\u2014while always delivering the satisfaction of solving what once seemed impossible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay built around switching between 2D and 3D perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels with evolving and interconnected mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of puzzles, from moving blocks to activating circuits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist and atmospheric aesthetic, designed for a clear and relaxing experience.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Tom\u00e1s Garri"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080740/643dc4e4ab6054fe2c4559768c71cb976212312c/header.jpg?t=1760682284","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4080740/1536156934/57c7b6616fbd90dbeba0312e8261cb9b88d34fdb/1760680580/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760682283","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4080740/1536156934/57c7b6616fbd90dbeba0312e8261cb9b88d34fdb/1760680580/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760682283","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4080740/1536156934/57c7b6616fbd90dbeba0312e8261cb9b88d34fdb/1760680580/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760682283","id":257219073,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219073/movie480.mp4?t=1760682283","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219073/movie_max.mp4?t=1760682283"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219073/0a1a6a9c109d7edcc9b9a94b31cd81e9f6a70a70/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760682283","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257219073/movie480.